    {
      "Col1": "Amaris Williams",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "OLB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "12.2",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "5/15/2026",
      "Col10": "Williams suffered a torn ACL during late spring drills, ending his campaign before it could begin. He remains sidelined for the entirety of the 2026 season while undergoing rehabilitation.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Dante Dowdell",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "RB",
      "Col6": "",
      "Col7": "14.3",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "7/21/2026",
      "Col10": "Dowdell continues to recover after sustaining undisclosed injuries in a late-July ATV incident. He remains on the out-for-season list with no current timetable for a return to team activities.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Tyriq Green",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "S",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "11.5",
      "Col8": "3",
      "Col9": "11/6/2026",
      "Col10": "Green was officially ruled out ahead of the November 7 contest due to a lingering ankle issue. The defensive back was unable to dress after being downgraded late in game-week preparations.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Thomas Blackshear",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "P",
      "Col5": "WR",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "11.0",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "11/6/2026",
      "Col10": "Blackshear was upgraded to probable after progressing through recovery from a collarbone injury suffered in early October. Despite trending in the right direction, coaching staff held him out of live action as a precautionary measure.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Chauncey Bowens",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "P",
      "Col5": "RB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "14.4",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "11/6/2026",
      "Col10": "Bowens advanced to probable status late in the week following a multi-week absence caused by a foot sprain. He was cleared for limited depth work but did not log snaps in Saturday’s matchup.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Elyiss Williams",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "Q",
      "Col5": "TE",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "16.0",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "11/7/2026",
      "Col10": "Williams was designated as a game-time decision after nursing a lower-leg injury sustained against Florida. Following pre-game warmups, the tight end was ultimately held out from game action.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "AJ Kruah",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "Q",
      "Col5": "ILB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "13.4",
      "Col8": "1",
      "Col9": "11/4/2026",
      "Col10": "Kruah was initially tabbed as questionable with an undisclosed ailment before being downgraded and ruled out on Friday. The inside linebacker did not participate and remains day-to-day moving forward.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Joseph Jonah-Ajonye",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "DL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "12.6",
      "Col8": "4",
